      "why": "The item is presented as a solo task with no dialogue, peer contributions, or need to respond to another person’s mathematical thinking. There is no evidence of collaboration or joint reasoning required to solve the item."
    },
    {
      "practice": "Procedural Fluency",
      "why": "The item does not require the student to perform any calculations, such as computing a mean, median, or range, nor to apply a procedure like converting units or solving equations. The task is purely visual and interpretive, not computational."
    }
  ]
}

